{
	"Name": "Search - Okta - Users - Accounts in a Locked or Recovery State [table]",
	"Description": "Lists Okta users sitting in a state that is not simply active or deprovisioned: LOCKED_OUT, PASSWORD_EXPIRED, RECOVERY, SUSPENDED, PROVISIONED, or STAGED. LOCKED_OUT and RECOVERY in particular are where password attacks and recovery abuse leave a trace on the account itself.\n\nRenders as a table.",
